%% alt: When output isn't good enough, ask why. Missing knowledge calls for retrieval, putting the facts in the prompt. Wrong behaviour calls for a better prompt and examples first, and fine-tuning only if it still fails an eval.
flowchart LR
  Q[Output not<br/>good enough]:::human --> K[Missing knowledge?]
  Q --> B[Wrong behaviour?]
  K -->|yes| R[RAG: put the facts<br/>in the prompt]:::tool
  B -->|yes| P[Better prompt<br/>and examples]:::model
  P -->|still failing an eval| F[Fine-tune]:::model
